{"id":67564,"date":"2025-10-25T10:33:32","date_gmt":"2025-10-25T09:33:32","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67564"},"modified":"2026-09-27T23:49:21","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T22:49:21","slug":"sao-silvestre-leiria","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-leiria\/","title":{"rendered":"2\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Leiria 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">2\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Leiria 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>2\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Leiria 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>20 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida e chegada na <strong>Avenida Bernardo Pimenta<\/strong>, em <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Organizada pelo prestigiado clube <strong>Juventude Vidigalense<\/strong> em estreita colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com o <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Leiria<\/strong> e com o apoio da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Distrital de Atletismo de Leiria, a prova celebra o esp\u00edrito natal\u00edcio e a corrida de estrada.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo apresenta a competitiva <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s <strong>10h00<\/strong> e caixas de partida por ritmo (boxes), bem como a participativa <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> com in\u00edcio \u00e0s <strong>10h15<\/strong>. O secretariado principal e levantamento de dorsais funciona na Porta 1 do Est\u00e1dio Municipal de Leiria nos dias 18, 19 e 20 de dezembro.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais garantem dorsal personalizado com chip eletr\u00f3nico, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos no percurso e na meta, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial alusiva ao evento e medalha exclusiva de participa\u00e7\u00e3o para todos os atletas que cortem a linha de meta.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC